+| D6 | `NOT ENFORCED` constraints | PG19 extends to `CHECK`; unchanged rationale |
+| D7 | `COPY TO` from MV / exports | PG19 adds `FORMAT json`, `ON_ERROR SET_NULL`; candidate for description-run export |
